  "notes": "The fuselage, titles and engines are the standard's (drawn from the A321neo N2017J and the A320s). The fin is Prism, read off D-AVSA's left side (2013) and checked mirrored on N999JQ and N989JT: the facets are placed by eye on the fin as built, simplified (some of the smaller facet lines inside the navy are left out). JetBlue's A321s carry Prism or Balloons; tagged airframes only.",
